  "description": {
   "en": "Liana le Merdi, the last remaining pyromancer, hopes to avenge her family's murder by the great Alseid Hallias. At death's door, she is given a second chance at life by the fire god... as her three-year-old self? When she stands in front of Hallias again, instead of being killed, she ends up being adopted! She must now work with her enemy to uncover the truth behind her family's death while escaping those who want to abuse her power. How will she survive when she can't even pronounce her r's?"
  },
